flowchart TB
    Mode[Session Mode] --> Autonomous[Autonomous Mode]
    Mode --> Observation[Observation Mode]
    Mode --> Suggestion[Suggestion Mode]

    Autonomous --> A1[Build State]
    A1 --> A2[Model selects action]
    A2 --> A3[System executes command]
    A3 --> A4[Parse output]
    A4 --> A5[Update KB]

    Observation --> O1[Build State]
    O1 --> O2[Human executes command]
    O2 --> O3[Extract / label action]
    O3 --> O4[Log state-action pair]
    O4 --> O5[Parse output]
    O5 --> O6[Update KB]

    Suggestion --> S1[Build State]
    S1 --> S2[Model suggests action]
    S2 --> S3[Human accepts or overrides]
    S3 --> S4[Execute chosen action]
    S4 --> S5[Log suggestion and final action]
    S5 --> S6[Update KB]